/T (In this project, I used nine SQL queries to extract meaningful insights from the sales dataset. The queries included calculating total revenue, total profit, total quantity sold, and total number of orders. I also analyzed revenue and profit by category and region to identify high-performing segments. Additional queries were used to determine the top 10 products based on revenue and to examine sales trends over time. Each query helped transform raw data into structured information for analysis. These SQL queries formed the foundation for further processing in Python and visualization in Microsoft Power BI, enabling clear business insights and performance evaluation.)
