<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 61 0 R
/T (The Sales Performance Dashboard provides an interactive analysis of revenue, profit, orders, and quantity using Microsoft Power BI. It includes key performance indicators such as Total Revenue, Total Profit, Profit Margin, Total Orders, and Total Quantity to give a quick overview of business performance. The dashboard visualizes revenue and profit by category and region, highlights the top 10 products, and shows sales trends over time. Interactive slicers for category, region, and order date allow users to filter and explore the data dynamically. This dashboard helps in identifying high-performing segments, understanding trends, and supporting data-driven business decisions)
/E (The Sales Performance Dashboard provides an interactive analysis of revenue, profit, orders, and quantity using Microsoft Power BI. It includes key performance indicators such as Total Revenue, Total Profit, Profit Margin, Total Orders, and Total Quantity to give a quick overview of business performance. The dashboard visualizes revenue and profit by category and region, highlights the top 10 products, and shows sales trends over time. Interactive slicers for category, region, and order date allow users to filter and explore the data dynamically. This dashboard helps in identifying high-performing segments, understanding trends, and supporting data-driven business decisions)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
